    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.pairs\n\n### Description\n\nSimilar to https://github.com/windwp/nvim-autopairs#dont-add-pairs-if-it-already-has-a-close-pair-in-the-same-line. If the cursor is in front of an already existing closing character, this plugin could decide to not add the closing pair.",
